WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.802
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
everybody.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:03.837
Thank you so much for watching.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:05.405
Peaceful protests continued

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.740
throughout the country
this weekend.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:09.609
All ages,
all races participating,

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:11.744
which should give us all hope.

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:14.813
And I think politicians are
hearing the message

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:19.251
loud and clear, which goes to
show you how powerful

00:00:19.251 --> 00:00:22.522
letting your voice
being heard is.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:27.293
So let's get to
some news and some jokes.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:28.828
Well, guys, it feels like
we are living through

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.396
some of the craziest times ever.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.632
Good news -- there's a new poll
out today to confirm it.

00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:38.070
-A new NBC News/Wall Street
Journal poll finds 80% of voters

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.707
feel that our country
is out of control.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.808
-Yeah, if we hit
90% out of control,

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:46.679
every American gets
their own show on Bravo, so...

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.482
That's right, 80% think
the country is out of control.

00:00:49.482 --> 00:00:52.152
Right now America is somewhere
between Trump's Twitter page

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:54.721
and J.K. Rowling's Twitter page.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.156
Even crazier, 15% of people

00:00:57.156 --> 00:01:00.526
think that things
are under control.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.895
Yeah.
When the Titanic was going down,

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.130
these were the people who were
trying to get

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.599
a drink at the bar.
"It's fine.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.967
Can I just get a gin and tonic?

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:15.107
It's a boat. What do boats do,
right? They float."

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:16.609
Here's some cool news.

00:01:16.609 --> 00:01:18.377
Yesterday Senator Mitt Romney

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:21.447
decided to march with
protesters.

00:01:21.447 --> 00:01:23.149
Man, you know you're starting to
reach white people

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:25.484
when you get the whitest
of all white people.

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:27.353
-We need a voice
against racism.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:30.456
We need many voices against
racism and against brutality.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:33.692
We need to stand up and say
that black lives matter.

00:01:33.692 --> 00:01:36.695
-When Mitt was spotted walking
with thousands of people,

00:01:36.695 --> 00:01:40.100
everyone just thought he was
taking his family to lunch.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.834
That's right --
Mitt Romney marched with

00:01:41.834 --> 00:01:43.802
Black Lives Matter protesters.

00:01:43.802 --> 00:01:45.805
That's like seeing
the Wu-Tang Clan

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:49.074
show up at a Kenny G concert.

00:01:49.074 --> 00:01:52.712
Yesterday on CNN, former
Secretary of State Colin Powell

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.215
shared his reasons for not
supporting President Trump.

00:01:56.215 --> 00:01:58.751
-One word I have to use with
respect to what he's doing

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:01.621
for the last several years is
a word I would never have used

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.991
before, I never would have used
with any of the four presidents

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.759
I've worked for -- he lies.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.260
He lies about things.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:09.863
-Apparently after upsetting
black people

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.865
and military leaders,
Trump decided

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:13.766
let's just roll it all into one.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:17.002
Meanwhile, in response to calls
from prominent NFL players,

00:02:17.002 --> 00:02:19.371
Commissioner Roger Goodell
released a statement

00:02:19.371 --> 00:02:21.874
over the weekend apologizing
on behalf of the league

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:24.477
for not listening
to players earlier. Take a look.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.380 line:0%
-We, the National Football
League, admit we were wrong for

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:30.984 line:0%
not listening to NFL players
earlier and encourage all

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.853 line:0%
to speak out
and peacefully protest.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:35.788
-You could tell
Goodell was nervous 'cause

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.658
I think he delivered that
from his underground bunker.

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:41.927
That's right. The NFL feels so
badly that they're this close

00:02:41.927 --> 00:02:47.300
to scheduling another fake
workout for Colin Kaepernick.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.634
Here's a fun fact.

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.536
I just said Colin Kaepernick's
name one more time

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:52.538
than Roger Goodell did.

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.040
Well, after hearing
all the news,

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.841
I know things seem
pretty volatile right now,

00:02:55.841 --> 00:02:58.511
but don't worry.
The President has a plan.

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:01.780
-We are learning the White House
is seriously considering

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:06.052
having President Trump give
a speech on race this week.

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.554
-Apparently Trump wants to get
those "country out of control"

00:03:08.554 --> 00:03:10.990
numbers up to 100%
by this weekend.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.326
Trump is thinking about giving a
big nationally televised speech

00:03:14.326 --> 00:03:16.495
about race and unity

00:03:16.495 --> 00:03:20.266
that's currently being written
by six white guys named Dale.

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:23.036
Yeah, on Thursday we'll hear
a nationally televised speech

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.670
about race and unity,
and on Friday,

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.707
we'll hear an apology speech for
what he said on Thursday.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:30.476
Trump is giving a speech
about race and unity.

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:31.977
It will be like listening
to a lecture

00:03:31.977 --> 00:03:36.515
on veganism from Joey Chestnut.

00:03:36.515 --> 00:03:38.551
For those of you who don't know

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:44.390
the competitive hot dog eating
and digesting world,

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.960
Joey Chestnut is the champ.
Anyway.

00:03:49.929 --> 00:03:51.330
If Trump gives
a national address,

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.398
it will be broadcast on
all major television networks,

00:03:53.398 --> 00:03:58.003
plus you can watch it on B.E.T.
with a laugh track.

00:03:58.003 --> 00:04:00.072
Trump may give an address
on race and unity.

00:04:00.072 --> 00:04:02.208
Then after that, J.K. Rowling
will give her thoughts

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:04.577
on the transgender community.

00:04:04.577 --> 00:04:07.680
Right now, Trump's giving the
unity speech a lot of thought.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.450
He's trying to decide if he
should deliver it from behind

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:14.287
the new White House fence or
inside his underground bunker.

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:16.255
That's right. Staffers
are a little worried about

00:04:16.255 --> 00:04:18.624
Trump's speech 'cause he wants
to talk about all the progress

00:04:18.624 --> 00:04:20.526
that he's made in Wakanda.

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:21.761
Hey, here's some good news.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:24.797
New York City started partially
reopening today.

00:04:24.797 --> 00:04:29.335
-We're celebrating, we're back,
we're reopening, we're excited.

00:04:29.335 --> 00:04:31.203
Our mojo's back.

00:04:31.203 --> 00:04:34.106
-Yeah, New York began phase one
of its reopening plan today.

00:04:34.106 --> 00:04:36.308
Phase two is
restaurants and bars.

00:04:36.308 --> 00:04:38.544
Then after everyone packs
restaurants and bars,

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:41.714
phase three is another
three months of quarantine.

00:04:41.714 --> 00:04:43.416
It's not just New York City.

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:45.251
Las Vegas has reopened too.

00:04:45.251 --> 00:04:48.621
Casinos said safety is
their number-one priority

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:50.222
then went back to
letting everyone smoke

00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:51.691
while they play craps.

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:53.425
That's right. Vegas is open,

00:04:53.425 --> 00:04:56.162
but temperature checks
are required at hotels.

00:04:56.162 --> 00:04:59.398
Security will be like,
"Either he has coronavirus

00:04:59.398 --> 00:05:01.801
or he just lost 50 grand
and is about to tell his wife."

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:03.369
That is our monologue,
everybody.

